	(descr "Inductor, Radial series, Radial, pin pitch=3.00mm, diameter=7.5mm, height=9.5mm, Ferrocore COIL0608 (PK choke), doc/COIL0608-0.33.pdf spec SP-060824114: A=7.5max B=9.5max D=0.65+/-0.05 E=3.0+/-0.5. Pads are 1.4mm, NOT the 2x-drill library convention (1.8mm): pin 1 is /SW_NODE and the pair carries the full 320V switching swing, so the gap is held at 1.600mm to clear the 1.5mm functional-insulation clearance floor in MySXRelay.kicad_dru. Do not enlarge the pads. Annular ring 0.25mm. 3D model is the stock D7.0mm P3.00mm body scaled 7.5/7.0 in XY and recentred; its 9.55mm height already matches B.")
